157	screen 2	DIALOGUE	NOT_STARTED	2	{"tag": "H1", "font": "Poppins", "size": 48, "text": "Welcome Screen Text", "color": "#1F2937", "steps": [{"name": "Leo", "side": "left", "step": 1, "text": "Hey Sam! What are you doing here today?", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Sam", "side": "left", "step": 2, "text": "Hi Leo! I'm just playing catch with my dog, Buster. He loves chasing the ball. What about you?", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Leo", "side": "left", "step": 3, "text": "I was just walking around. I got a new skateboard yesterday, and I'm trying to get better at riding it.", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Sam", "side": "left", "step": 4, "text": "Oh, that's cool! I've always wanted to try skateboarding. Is it hard?", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Leo", "side": "left", "step": 5, "text": "A little at first, but it's getting easier. Do you like playing sports?", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Sam", "side": "left", "step": 6, "text": "Yeah, I love soccer! My team practices here sometimes. Do you play soccer?", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Leo", "side": "left", "step": 7, "text": "Not really, but I like watching it. I'm more into video games and drawing.", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Sam", "side": "left", "step": 8, "text": "That's awesome! What kind of video games do you play? And what do you like to draw?", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Leo", "side": "left", "step": 9, "text": "I like adventure games, and I usually draw superheroes and funny monsters. Maybe I can show you some of my drawings sometime.", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Sam", "side": "left", "step": 10, "text": "I'd like that! My favorite superhero is Captain Comet. Do you know him?", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Leo", "side": "left", "step": 11, "text": "Yep! He's super fast. So, what are you doing this weekend?", "avatarColor": "#3b82f6"}, {"name": "Sam", "side": "left", "step": 12, "text": "I think my family is going to the movies